<i>♪ Make every loving moment rock. ♪</i>

782
01:13:22.267 --> 01:13:24.840
<i>♪ Love's makes your heart rock. ♪</i>

783
01:13:24.841 --> 01:13:28.675
<i>♪ Come, sway in the path of love. ♪</i>

784
